@format 1
@id tools.discover-ffmpeg
@title Discover FFmpeg library
@area Tools
@entry input
@summary Choose the FFmpeg library used by Flyleaf from the explicit preference, stored renderer setting, or discovered local installation.
@flow TB
@related application.startup

@alias renderer = Cadroue.UIShell.LRenderer
@alias library = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LRendererLibrary

[input] Preview renderer starts <input>
- Begin Flyleaf engine configuration @ renderer.LRendererFlyleafStart(...)
> explicit

[explicit] Check configured folders <decision>
- Validate the user preference first, then the stored renderer-library folder @ library.LRendererFolderValidate(...)
? "A configured folder is valid" > start
? "No configured folder is valid" > discover

[discover] Search local installation <process>
- Search supported local locations for an FFmpeg library folder @ library.LRendererFolderFind(...)
> start

[start] Start preview engine <decision>
- Start Flyleaf with the resolved folder or its default resolution @ renderer.LRendererFlyleafStart(...)
? "Engine starts" > result
? "Startup throws" > failed

[result] Renderer available <output>
= Flyleaf preview uses the highest-priority usable FFmpeg library source.

[failed] Renderer startup failed <error>
= The failure is logged and preview rendering is unavailable.
